Description: GPU module set {{ SET }} profile (fused brands, loader policy)
 GPU FINAL (owner 2026-11-05): ONE fused GPU module deb per usage set and
 flavour, carrying EVERY brand the architecture can run: amdgpu (the DC pin
 of the set), i915/xe and — on amd64 — the NVIDIA OPEN kernel modules built
 inside this same deb (the former linux-modules-nvidia pair is absorbed);
 no NVIDIA at all on arm64. The NVIDIA userspace is never one of ours: it
 comes from NVIDIA's own signed repository at the derive step. The set the
 machine runs is chosen AT INSTALL (bootc-installer GPU profile selector,
 P-513a pattern) — the image carries no set; the bootc-installer pulls this
 deb from the APT repo and the loader policy lands in
 /etc/modprobe.d/dc-gpu-{{ SET }}.conf. The sets conflict with each other:
 exactly one can be installed. The -nvidia variants carry only the loader
 policy: everything it pins goes through its sibling fused set.
